==Strategy==
Usin a fast attacking unit such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and its [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|crazed version]] to clear out the Ws and a cat with good DPS for the Chocolate Wall Doges. Wave Blockers are not required as Chocolate Wall Doge's [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Waves]] deal minimal damage.

Alternatively, if you're late enough to have [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]], it one-shots the base, so just sending it out should be enough.

